*/*          THE SAME FIELD EXISTS IN BOTH CONTROL BLOCKS, THEY MUST */ 00003300
*/*          REMAIN AT MATCHING OFFSETS.  THESE FIELDS ARE ALWAYS THE*/ 00003400
