*/* THE FOLLOWING TWO QUEUES POINT TO CIRCULAR PARTE QUEUES FOR 02S0042 00007400
*   LOCAL PAGE DATA SETS.                                            */ 00007500
*                                                               02S0042 00007600
*         5 PARTCIR1 PTR(31),       /* POINTER TO NEXT PARTE FROM       00007700
*                                      WHICH TO ALLOCATE SLOTS FOR      00007800
*                                      FIXED HEAD FILES              */ 00007900
*         5 PARTCIR2 PTR(31),       /* POINTER TO NEXT PARTE FROM       00008000
*                                      WHICH TO ALLOCATE SLOTS FOR      00008100
