*                                      ONE OR MORE PCT'S THAT HAVE      00009200
*                                      BEEN BUILT FOR THE DEVICE        00009300
*                                      TYPES CONTAINING OPEN PAGE       00009400
*                                      DATA SETS                     */ 00009500
